{
 "annotations": {
  "destructiveHint": false,
  "idempotentHint": true,
  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "List saved searches"
 },
 "description": "Liste des recherches sauvegardees de l'utilisateur (page /news - Veille de l'app Insourcia).\n\nUtiliser cet outil :\n- AVANT create_saved_search, pour verifier qu'une veille equivalente n'existe pas deja et eviter les doublons de nom.\n- Pour repondre a \"quelles veilles ai-je ?\" / \"quelles sont mes recherches sauvegardees ?\".\n\nReponse : { saved_searches: [{ id, name, filters (filtres normalises stockes), result_count (nombre de societes matchant, null si indisponible), alert_enabled (alerte quotidienne nouvelles societes active ou non), url (page /news), created_at }], total }. Les recherches sont triees de la plus recente a la plus ancienne. Liste vide = aucune veille configuree.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "limit": {
    "description": "Nombre max de recherches retournees (defaut 100)",
    "maximum": 9007199254740991,
    "minimum": -9007199254740991,
    "type": "integer"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "list_saved_searches",
 "outputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": {},
  "properties": {
   "saved_searches": {
    "items": {
     "additionalProperties": {},
     "properties": {
      "alert_enabled": {
       "type": "boolean"
      },
      "created_at": {
       "anyOf": [
        {
         "type": "string"
        },
        {
         "type": "null"
        }
       ]
      },
      "filters": {
       "anyOf": [
        {
         "additionalProperties": {},
         "propertyNames": {
          "type": "string"
         },
         "type": "object"
        },
        {
         "type": "null"
        }
       ]
      },
      "id": {
       "type": "string"
      },
      "name": {
       "type": "string"
      },
      "result_count": {
       "anyOf": [
        {
         "type": "number"
        },
        {
         "type": "null"
        }
       ]
      },
      "url": {
       "type": "string"
      }
     },
     "required": [
      "id",
      "name",
      "result_count",
      "alert_enabled",
      "url"
     ],
     "type": "object"
    },
    "type": "array"
   },
   "total": {
    "type": "number"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "saved_searches",
   "total"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 }
}
